0. GENERAL PROVISIONS
Synapse is a free project. It has always been, is, and will remain completely free of charge.

This license applies to all original parts of the project:
- In-game mod (.package and .ts4script)
- Bridge application and launcher (ai_bridge.py, launcher.py, .bat files, any .exe files)
- Original author presets, system prompts, configuration files, and settings
- Icons, UI design, visual assets, and graphics
- Documentation, texts, and descriptions

Distribution terms are divided into two parts:
- Creative materials (graphics, icons, UI design, texts, original prompts and author presets, documentation) are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/
- Software code (mod, bridge application, launcher, scripts, executable files) is governed by the author's proprietary Source-Available terms set forth below. Creative Commons officially does not recommend its licenses for software; therefore, the code is licensed separately.

Third-Party Components. The terms of this license do not apply to third-party open-source libraries and components included in the project or its builds (including .exe binaries). Such components are used and distributed under the terms of their respective original licenses.

The permissions described in Section 1 (specifically regarding translations and user presets) constitute express individual exceptions granted by the author to the NoDerivatives condition of the CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 license and apply strictly within the scope defined in this document.

1. WHAT IS PERMITTED
- Personal Non-Commercial Use. You are permitted to download, install, and run the mod, bridge application, and accompanying files free of charge for personal, non-commercial use.
- Local Modification Strictly for Personal Use. You are permitted to modify the source code, scripts, configuration files, as well as locally adapt the author's original presets and prompts strictly for your own personal use on your own device, subject to the following conditions:
  * any modified files are strictly prohibited from being published (including in public repositories and forks), uploaded publicly, or shared with third parties in any form (including private chats, channels, and acquaintances);
  * you assume all risks related to the functionality, stability, and consequences of any changes you make.
- Free Redistribution. You may share the original, unmodified mod and bridge application on any websites, forums, and file-hosting services, provided all of the following conditions are met:
  * mandatory attribution to the author (Thistle / ThistleInHeart), indication of the exact version number of the distributed release, its edition type (SFW / NSFW / NSFW EXTRA, preserving the 18+ label where applicable), and a direct active link to the official project repository (https://github.com/ThistleInHeart/Synapse);
  * download access must be strictly free of charge — without paid subscriptions, paid roles, donation walls, or mandatory ad-viewing services (standard website banner ads or optional file-host premium plans for faster downloads are permitted);
  * the archive and all files must be distributed strictly separately (outside of compilations and modpacks) and in their original state, without any modifications or repackaging of executable files.
- Translations into Any Language. No monetization restrictions are imposed by the Synapse author on standalone translation files (early access, subscriptions, donations are at the translator's discretion; no royalties to the author are required), provided the translator independently complies with the current EA Modding Policy. Translation files are strictly defined as: a standalone .package file for the game installed on top of the original mod; or a standalone .txt / .json localization file for the bridge application. Conditions:
  * the translation must be distributed strictly as a separate file, and the release must not include files of the original mod or bridge;
  * the translator must explicitly state that the translation is unofficial (fan-made) and that the mod author (Thistle) has no affiliation with any fundraising for the localization.
- Custom Presets and Prompts. Users are permitted to create their own (written from scratch) character, lore presets, and system prompts for Synapse, share them with the community, or monetize them under any terms. Conditions:
  * they must be distributed strictly as standalone configuration/text files without including code, the author's original presets, or files of the mod or bridge itself;
  * in case of paid distribution, the preset creator must explicitly state that the material is unofficial and that the mod author (Thistle) has no affiliation with any fundraising.
- Integrations and Add-ons. Creation of external scripts and applications that communicate with the mod's API is permitted, provided they contain no Synapse code and are distributed free of charge.
- Streaming, Videos, Reviews, and Guides. Permitted, including on monetized channels and publications, provided proper attribution and a link to the official project repository are included.
- Source Code Inspection and Project Contributions (GitHub). You are permitted to study the project's source code (Source-Available) for educational and informational purposes, as well as for personal security auditing. Creating a fork on GitHub is permitted solely for inspecting the code or submitting a Pull Request to the official repository; distributing builds from forks or maintaining independent public modifications without the author's consent is prohibited. By submitting a Pull Request, the contributor agrees to the inclusion and distribution of their contribution as part of the project under the terms of this license.

2. WHAT IS STRICTLY PROHIBITED
- Selling the mod, bridge application, their code, original author presets and prompts, or any parts, assets, or modifications thereof.
- Distributing the mod, bridge, or any forks thereof via paid early access, paid roles, subscriptions, or paywalls (Patreon, Boosty, Ko-fi, private Telegram/Discord channels, and similar platforms). The only exception applies strictly to standalone localization files and user-created presets/prompts written from scratch (Section 1).
- Collecting funds, donations, or tips in the name of the author (Thistle / ThistleInHeart) or under the pretext of funding the development or maintenance of the Synapse project.
- Including the mod, bridge application, or any project files in any mod compilations, modpacks, game repacks, or pre-made Mods folders (whether paid or free).
- Claiming authorship, or removing, modifying, or obscuring copyright notices, metadata, version numbers, or author credits.
- Publishing, uploading to public access, or sharing with third parties modified versions of the mod, bridge, executable files, or assets without the express written consent of the author (local edits strictly for personal use on your own device without redistribution are permitted under Section 1; creating a GitHub fork is permitted solely for code inspection or submitting a Pull Request).
- Using the "Synapse" name, icons, or project branding for your own projects in a manner that misleads users regarding authorship.
- Reuploading files to platforms where compliance with the conditions above is impossible.

