Synapse is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, functionality, and compatibility (including compatibility with third-party translations and custom presets after mod updates).

The author shall not be liable for any direct or indirect damages arising out of the use of the project, including (but not limited to):
- loss or corruption of game saves, damage to game files, or operating system malfunctions;
- any financial expenses, charges, token overuse, account bans, or limit exhaustion incurred when using third-party API keys and cloud services;
- leakage or unauthorized use of the user's API keys and credentials;
- the content, nature, accuracy, appropriateness, censorship, or legality of any text or other content generated by connected Large Language Models (LLMs). The mod author does not control third-party neural network outputs and bears no responsibility for them;
- any consequences of transmitting user data to third-party AI service providers.

The user is solely responsible for backing up their data, safeguarding their API keys and confidential information in configuration files and logs (including removing them before publishing files or requesting support), monitoring expenses on their API accounts, and complying with the terms of use of third-party AI services connected via the bridge application.

Age Restrictions (18+) and Project Editions. The Synapse project is released in three editions: SFW, NSFW, and NSFW EXTRA. If the release title, archive name, or description of a specific version does not indicate its edition type, that version is automatically considered the NSFW EXTRA edition.
- The NSFW and NSFW EXTRA editions (as well as any versions without an explicit edition label) are intended exclusively for adult users (18+ or the age of majority established by the laws of the user's country of residence).
- By downloading, installing, or using the NSFW or NSFW EXTRA editions, the user confirms that they have reached the age of majority and assumes sole responsibility for complying with the laws of their jurisdiction.
- Even when using the SFW edition, the author does not guarantee complete censorship of generated texts, as they are produced by third-party Large Language Models (LLMs).
- When freely redistributing (Section 1) the NSFW and NSFW EXTRA editions, you must preserve the edition type label and the appropriate 18+ age warning, as well as comply with the rules of the hosting platform.

